{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI have arrived in Hamburg, though not yet in our arms. The ship brought me here at ten, but the journey home is blocked. I received your two letters, a welcome relief to my solitary mind, and have sent my luggage to the post office for the express coach. Yet, alas, no seats remain for Wednesday. I am confined to the König von Hannover inn, waiting for Monday’s post wagon, which will finally bring me to Berlin by Thursday.\n\nThe delay is a minor inconvenience, but the thought of your letters keeps my spirits high. I trust Karl and Immanuel are well, and that you are managing the household without too much strain. I am in good health, if somewhat weary from the sea air. I shall wait these days with patience, for freedom is the end of all striving, even that of a man waiting for a carriage.\n\nGive my love to the boys.\n\nYours,\nG. W. F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795218982,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":202,"prompt_tokens":940,"total_tokens":1142,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-aNhkLl935BRWWTekGa40bGiqiMZlaAQN","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":940,"prompt_ms":920.552,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9793106382978723,"prompt_per_second":1021.1264545620454,"predicted_n":202,"predicted_ms":4737.667,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.570482587064678,"predicted_per_second":42.42594509069548}}